{"synopsis":"Perubahan global terjadi, permainan menjadi kenyataan, dan bencana setan mulai mendatangkan malapetaka. Untuk menolak semua ini, setiap orang harus memilih kelas dan naik level seperti orang gila. Lin Ye membangkitkan bakat tingkat dewa dari awal, membalikkan keadaan, dan mulai berlari cepat langsung dari ruang bawah tanah teratas. Imam lemah? Jika saya menggunakan teknik penyembuhan, Anda mungkin mati!","alternative_title":"我！灾厄级牧师","author":"WenYuan Culture (闻源文化), 甘甘甘雨","artist":"WenYuan Culture (闻源文化), 甘甘甘雨","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"87b36259-6092-4145-bc4d-cc6e37e9949e","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2025-09-14","released":"2025-09-14"},{"chapter_id":"27106821-3991-48db-bb6f-ef028e4807ec","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2025-09-14","released":"2025-09-14"},{"chapter_id":"98ad3a3e-5641-4504-b530-dc2239154acc","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2025-09-14","released":"2025-09-14"},{"chapter_id":"73f931a0-4c9a-4f58-bd62-c1aa2d27e900","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2025-08-16","released":"2025-08-16"},{"chapter_id":"05c95f0b-73de-4b52-bbf8-bb4b15adfd35","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2025-08-16","released":"2025-08-16"},{"chapter_id":"7acc4005-1a93-421c-99f0-659a2c5b5b0e","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2025-07-31","released":"2025-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"46085bf6-8dfe-4145-88b4-fda82fa013a9","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2025-07-30","released":"2025-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"417459a6-e8d3-412c-9e51-517629a55d3a","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2025-07-19","released":"2025-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"99f8593f-a39e-44f9-9abc-cd894bd3863c","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2025-07-19","released":"2025-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"4656a426-9cca-482e-9689-a0973b72a130","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2025-07-02","released":"2025-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"79326a9b-acd8-4e9e-a49b-dcb5fa837f7a","number":"46","chapter":